      "channelId": "UCFv29ANLT2FQmtvS9DRixNA",
      "title": "The Making of Wizard.Fit - Part 3: 40 Yoga Instructors, 1 App Sprint",
      "description": "Enjoy part 1 of this series here - https://www.topcoder.com/wizard-fit-part-i-the-suddenly-unemployed-world-of-fitness/\nAnd part 2 of the series here - https://www.topcoder.com/wizard-fit-part-2/\n \nSoofi Safavi and his team are building out a new fitness application amidst the Coronavirus and he’s doing it through 100% distributed virtual talent. Plus, he’s going from idea to live MVP in about 14 days.\n \nIn part 3 of this series hear from Soofi as he details the progress made in the last 7 days. Through rapid feedback cycles with a group of 40 yoga trainers, Soofi and the team are pushing the prototype through design and dev at hyper-pace. They plan to have a working MVP for instructors to start using in about two weeks.\n \nFor more info on using remote technology talent via Topcoder visit www.topcoder.com",
